00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,132
B, acidic.

2
00:00:01,132 --> 00:00:05,716
Ammonium chloride is the salt of a strong acid and a weak base.

3
00:00:05,716 --> 00:00:10,989
The ammonium ion gives a proton to water, producing hydrogen ions.

4
00:00:10,989 --> 00:00:15,781
The chloride ion, conjugate base of a strong acid, does nothing.

